<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45933" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχθος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς ἔχθος ἀλευάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.277
				</span></i>
			: and in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχθεα λυγρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.416
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.55
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴδια, κοινὰ ἔχθεα</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.82
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ ἔχθος τινός</span>
			<i>hatred for</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				9.15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.103
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.57
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχθει</span> c.gen., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				332
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.95
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς ἔχθεα ἀπικνέεσθαί
			τινι</span> to incur his <i>enmity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.82
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἔχθος ἐλθεῖν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					879
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἔχθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Publ.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ πλεῖστον ἔ.</span>
			<i>object of</i> direst <i>hate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				284
			</span></i>.—In Prose <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχθρα</span>
			is more freq.</div>
